>
> What is {xekri je mlatu}? One black cat or two objects, one black and
> another one being a cat?
>
>

Tanru logical connectives were never officially well defined. The usual
take has always been that "ko'a xekri je mlatu" expands to "ge ko'a xekri
gi ko'a mlatu", but the first problem already arises when you put something
in the x2 of "xekri je mlatu".

mu'o mi'e xorxes

